\"><img src=\"https://link.axios.com/img/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94as5as5.4vcv/e53d278d.gif\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\" /></a></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-right:3.5%\" align=\"right\"> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47276501.227263/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tL25ld3NsZXR0ZXJzL2F4aW9zLWZpbmlzaC1saW5lLTc2MmJmMmI5LTQ1MmEtNGU4Ni1iYmRmLTMyMWZlZjNhMWJiZS5odG1sP3V0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aBd19e4fa5\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"b\" style=\"color:#222;font-size:13px;font-family:'gordita',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-decoration:underline\">View in browser</a> </td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"30\" style=\"height:30px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>  <tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align:center;line-height:1.3\">  <span class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.4px;color:#222;font-family:'gorditamedium',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">PRESENTED BY PEPSICO </span>  </td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"16\" style=\"height:16px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align:center;line-height:1\">\r\n<span class=\"s\" style=\"font-size:44px;font-family:'gorditamedium',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#008dc8;letter-spacing:-1px;line-height:1\"> Axios Finish Line </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align:center;line-height:1.5;padding-bottom:35px;padding-top:10px\">\r\n<span class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#222;font-family:'gorditamedium',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">By  Mike Allen and Erica Pandey and Jim VandeHei  <span style=\"margin:0 6px\">&middot;</span> Aug 31, 2026 </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td class=\"v\" style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:Georgia,serif;line-height:1.75;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px;padding:0 3.5%\"><p>🌙 <strong>Good evening.</strong> Tonight's host is Axios' Ashley May, sharing a simple summer ritual she started with her kids.</p><ul><li><em>Smart Brevity™ count: 309 words … 1 min. Edited by Natalie Daher and copy edited by Amy Stern.</em></li></ul></td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0;border-bottom:10px solid #f5f5f5\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>      <tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 10px;line-height:1.5\">\r\n<span class=\"b k\" style=\"font-size:27px;font-family:'gorditamedium',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px;line-height:1.5\">  1 big thing: 15-minute rituals </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>   <tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td> <img src=\"https://images.axios.com/iAPavAUt04x9xnjdOMNQIul0peI=/0x0:1920x1080/1920x1080/2026/08/12/1786559122852.jpeg\" width=\"600\" style=\"width:100%\" id=\"item02\" alt=\"Illustration of a clock face set to 15 after the hour with two pairs of shoes hanging from the minute hand. \"> </td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:0 3.5%;line-height:1.3\">\r\n<span class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#848484\"> <p>Illustration: Aïda Amer/Axios. Stock: Getty Images</p> </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr> <tr>\r\n<td class=\"v\" style=\"padding:0 3.5%;line-height:1.75;font-size:17px;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px\"><p><strong>My favorite 15 minutes</strong> of the day are completely ordinary: My kids and I walk around the neighborhood, <em>Axios' Ashley May writes.</em></p><ul><li><strong>Why it matters: </strong>This ritual has become the setting for some of my favorite moments and conversations of the year.</li></ul><p><strong>💭 My son</strong> tells me about his dreams — often literally what he dreamt about last night. My daughter and I try to spot the chirping birds.</p><ul><li><strong>Sometimes</strong> we don't talk at all. We just move forward together.</li></ul><p>📍 <strong>There are some</strong> ground rules:</p><ul><li><strong>No devices</strong> allowed. That way, I'm not checking the time or notifications.</li><li><strong>I bring my coffee</strong> with me. I've found that I<strong> </strong>can sustain only one leisurely morning ritual at a time, so the mug comes along. </li><li><strong>The dog stays</strong> home. He'll get his own walk later, where he'll trot and sniff at whatever pace he wants.</li></ul><p>🧭 <strong>We don't have a set route.</strong> We <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47276501.227263/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tLzIwMjMvMTIvMDYvd2Fsa2luZy13YW5kZXJpbmctaGVhbHRoLWZsYW5ldXI_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1uZXdzbGV0dGVyJnV0bV9tZWRpdW09ZW1haWwmdXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXJfYXhpb3NmaW5pc2hsaW5lJnN0cmVhbT10b3A/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB4e77d951\" target=\"_blank\">wander</a>. We've found new gardens, new neighbors and even a garage art gallery.</p><p><strong>Exercise scientist </strong>and dad <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47276501.227263/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuY29sdW1iaWFjYXJkaW9sb2d5Lm9yZy9wcm9maWxlL2tlaXRoLWRpYXotcGhkP3V0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aBf7df77d7\" target=\"_blank\">Keith Diaz</a> tells me our walks are building a healthy habit that could help my kids buck recent trends.</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47276501.227263/aHR0cHM6Ly9wbWMubmNiaS5ubG0ubmloLmdvdi9hcnRpY2xlcy9QTUM3NTc0NzkxLz91dG1fc291cmNlPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXImdXRtX21lZGl1bT1lbWFpbCZ1dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249bmV3c2xldHRlcl9heGlvc2ZpbmlzaGxpbmUmc3RyZWFtPXRvcA/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aBa6ad5c7a\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Research</strong></a><strong> shows</strong> children's physical activity drops steadily between ages 6 and 17, with a particularly sharp decline around ages 9 to 12. </li><li><strong>Daily walks</strong> can be \"movement as medicine, but on their level,\" Diaz says.</li></ul><p><strong>What's next: </strong>I know my kids won't always want to walk with me. But maybe one day these walks will help them find their own way.</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47276501.227263/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tLzIwMjYvMDkvMDEvaGVhbHRoeS1yb3V0aW5lcy0xNS1taW51dGUtd2Fsa3Mta2lkcz91dG1fc291cmNlPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXImdXRtX21lZGl1bT1lbWFpbCZ1dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249bmV3c2xldHRlcl9heGlvc2ZpbmlzaGxpbmUmc3RyZWFtPXRvcA/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB64ee3f62\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Share this story</em></a><em>.</em></li></ul></td>\r\n</tr> <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 25px\">   <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47276501.227263/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuZmFjZWJvb2suY29tL3NoYXJlci5waHA_dT1odHRwczovL3d3dy5heGlvcy5jb20vbmV3c2xldHRlcnMvYXhpb3MtZmluaXNoLWxpbmUtNzYyYmYyYjktNDUyYS00ZTg2LWJiZGYtMzIxZmVmM2ExYmJlLmh0bWw_Y2h1bmslM0QxJTI2dXRtX3Rlcm0lM0RmYnNvY2lhbHNoYXJlJTIzc3RvcnkxJnV0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB6f47bd03\" style=\"display:inline-block\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://static.axios.com/img/axios-site/newsletters/logos/footer/share-facebook-circle-border.png\" alt=\"Share on Facebook\"></a> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47276501.227263/aHR0cHM6Ly90d2l0dGVyLmNvbS9pbnRlbnQvdHdlZXQ_\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:7px\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://static.axios.com/img/axios-site/newsletters/logos/footer/share-x-circle-border.png\" alt=\"Tweet this Story\"></a> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47276501.\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:7px\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://static.axios.com/img/axios-site/newsletters/logos/footer/share-linkedin-circle-border.png\" alt=\"Post to LinkedIn\"></a>  <a href=\"mailto:?subject=From Axios: 1 big thing: 15-minute rituals&body=teruyuki%